Package: modelterms7
Title: Model Terms as Objects for Formula-Based Modeling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Giovanni", "Tinervia", , "giovannitinervia9@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Model terms as 'S7' objects: the mapping from a data frame to
    a design-matrix block, the penalty attached to the block's
    coefficients, and the metadata a fit reads, with a formula interpreter
    that recognizes term constructors by what they return rather than by
    name, so user-defined terms work in formulas without registration.
    Includes the unpenalized parametric term and the censored-response
    constructor. Part of the 'statmodels7' toolkit.
